              and hence
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi F
                    %mo ′
                    %mo =
                    %mi Y
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi c
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo ×
                    %mi F
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} F ' = Y(c) \times F
              with respect to the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+monoidal+structure+on+presheaves"} closed monoidal structure on presheaves
          %p
            See
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/over-topos"} over-topos
            for more.
          %h2#overcategories_of_presheaf_categories_and_presheaves_on_categories_of_elements Over-categories of presheaf categories and presheaves on categories of elements
          %p Generalizing the above,
          .un_prop
            %h6#proposition_2 Proposition
            %p
              For every
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi P
